{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"b8f70b44-38c9-41a8-b3e5-c1ebecd8646b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture. Let me understand Q4.5:\n\n**Q4.5**: 有哪些 kernel 调度框架、编译器后端、kernel 生成方法与编程模型支持 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 模型在单 GPU/NPU/加速器上的多算子/微算子并发？\n\nThis is at L4 Kernel Scheduling level, with a focus on hardware architecture.\n\nThe key areas to cover:\n1. GPU ecosystem: Triton, CUTLASS, CUDA Graph, CUDA Stream, cuBLAS/cuDNN\n2. NPU ecosystem: CANN/TBE/TIK\n3. TPU/accelerator: JAX/XLA, Groq Compiler\n4. Cross-platform: TVM, MLIR, OpenAI Triton IR\n5. Concurrent kernel scheduling: persistent kernel, CUDA Graph DAG, dynamic parallelism\n\nFrom hardware architecture perspective: how each framework maps to hardware instructions (Triton→PTX→SASS, TBE→TIK IR→NPU instructions), and abstraction level of different hardware concurrency features.\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Do semantic segmentation of the question\n2. Search across 4 directories for each node\n3. Read the top results\n4. Write the answer\n\nLet me start with semantic segmentation and searching.\n\nThe question has these logical components:\n- S1: Kernel scheduling frameworks, compiler backends, kernel generation methods, programming models (Triton, CUTLASS, CUDA Graph/Stream, CANN/TBE/TIK, JAX/XLA, TVM, MLIR)\n- S2: Support for MoE, DiT, multimodal, Video models\n- S3: Multi-operator/micro-operator concurrency on single GPU/NPU/accelerator\n- S4: Hardware architecture perspective - framework→hardware instruction mapping (Triton→PTX→SASS, TBE→TIK IR→NPU)\n- S5: Abstraction level of different hardware concurrency features (warp scheduler, SM, systolic array)\n\nLet me construct the logical chain and search queries.","signature":"b8f70b44-38c9-41a8-b3e5-c1ebecd8646b"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":23738,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"