{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"b8f70b44-38c9-41a8-b3e5-c1ebecd8646b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Step 1: 语义分割 + Vault 搜索\n\n### 1.1 问题文本与预关键词已读取\n\nQ4.5 预关键词：Triton, CUTLASS, CUDA Graph, CUDA Stream, CANN/TBE/TIK, JAX/XLA, TVM, MLIR, persistent kernel, dynamic parallelism, PTX, SASS, kernel fusion 等。\n\n### 1.2 语义分割：逻辑链条\n\n| 节点 | 原文片段 | 逻辑角色 | 核心概念 | 长匹配 query |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|-------------|\n| S1 | Triton/CUTLASS/CUDA Graph/CUDA Stream/cuBLAS/cuDNN | GPU 生态框架 | Triton, CUTLASS, CUDA Graph, CUDA Stream | `path:paper_secs Triton CUTLASS \"CUDA Graph\" kernel scheduling` |\n| S2 | CANN/TBE/TIK 的 kernel 编程与调度 | NPU 生态框架 | CANN, TBE, TIK, Ascend | `path:paper_secs CANN TBE TIK Ascend kernel` |\n| S3 | JAX/XLA TPU kernel 生成、Groq Compiler | TPU/加速器生态 | JAX, XLA, Groq, TPU | `path:paper_secs JAX XLA TPU kernel generation` |\n| S4 | TVM/MLIR 跨平台 kernel 调度 | 跨平台框架 | TVM, MLIR, triton-gpu dialect, AutoScheduler | `path:paper_secs TVM MLIR \"triton-gpu\" kernel compilation` |\n| S5 | persistent kernel work-item 并发、CUDA Graph DAG、dynamic parallelism | 并发 kernel 调度方法 | persistent kernel, CUDA Graph, dynamic parallelism, device-side launch | `path:paper_secs \"persistent kernel\" \"CUDA Graph\" concurrency` |\n| S6 | 框架→硬件指令映射 (Triton→PTX→SASS, TBE→TIK IR→NPU) | 硬件体系结构侧重 | PTX, SASS, TIK IR, instruction mapping, hardware abstraction | `path:paper_secs PTX SASS \"hardware instruction\" mapping kernel` |\n\nNow let me search across all 4 directories for each node. I'll start with Level A searches in parallel."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":23738,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"481c05ba-2d76-4ba8-b9b0-f0e1195499be","uuid":"07d235a4-3bfb-40f6-9887-5d2e9f925f26"}
