hAttention-3 的 inference 实现中（contributed by Kai Londenberg），PagedAtt…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Vector Sparsity _ Fine-Grained Block Sparsity.md\",\"basename\":\"Vector Sparsity _ Fine-Grained Block Sparsity\",\"score\":290.7777835472684,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"block_row\",\"block-sparse\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Block\",\"offset\":34},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":118},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":134},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":173},{\"match\":\"block-sparse\",\"offset\":208},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":228},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":291},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":363},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":493},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":759},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1000},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1125},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1284},{\"match\":\"block_row\",\"offset\":1530},{\"match\":\"block_row\",\"offset\":1566}],\"excerpt\":\"## Vector Sparsity / Fine-Grained Block Sparsity\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nVector Sparsity 是一种细粒度 block sparse 格式，block size 为 $(1, B_c)$ 或 $(B_r, 1)$，即 block 在某一个维度上 size=1（\\\"vector\\\"）。传统的 block-sparse 格式通常要求 block sizes 是 tensor core MMA 指令维度的倍数（如 NVIDIA mma 最小维度 16），导致 block sizes 至少为 (16, 16) 或更大——这对 fine-grain…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Token-Level Overlapping _ Token-Level Pipelining.md\",\"basename\":\"Token-Level Overlapping _ Token-Level Pipelining\",\"score\":287.70539857204625,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"block，增加\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":35},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":104},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":330},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":387},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":568},{\"match\":\"block，增加\",\"offset\":938},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":1280}],\"excerpt\":\"## Token-Level Overlapping / Token-Level Pipelining\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nToken-Level Overlapping（Token级重叠）是一种在 MoE 训练中隐藏 all-to-all (A2