":1251},{\"match\":\"在所有 b\",\"offset\":1348},{\"match\":\"ing Block-\",\"offset\":1408},{\"match\":\"bit Block-\",\"offset\":1445}],\"excerpt\":\"## Signed Absolute Block Maximum Normalization（带符号绝对块最大值归一化 / BOF4-S 归一化）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nSigned Absolute Block Maximum Normalization 是 BOF4 论文提出的归一化改进。传统 absmax normalization 除以 `max_i |w_{b,i}|`（恒正），归一化后权重在 [-1,1]，两端各有 1/(2I) 离散概率质量。Signed 版本改用 `w_b^max = w_{b, argmax_i|w_{b,i}|}`（带符号值），…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Iteration-Level Scheduling（迭代级调度）.md\",\"basename\":\"Iteration-Level Scheduling（迭代级调度）\",\"score\":258.0202261888517,\"foundWords\":[\"blocking。\",\"blocking\",\"level\",\"level是multi\",\"level成为de\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":13},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":70},{\"match\":\"level成为de\",\"offset\":201},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":453},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":548},{\"match\":\"blocking。\",\"offset\":1238},{\"match\":\"level是multi\",\"offset\":1552},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1583},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":1644}],\"excerpt\":\"## Iteration-Level Scheduling（迭代级调度）\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nIteration-Level Scheduling是当前LLM serving的主流调度范式，以一次完整模型forward pass（穿过所有transformer layers）作为最小调度和批处理单元。Orca提出continuous batching后，iteration-level成为de facto标准：系统在每个iteration开始时决定哪些请求参与本轮batch，整轮执行全部N层后，在下一iteration加入新请求或移除已完成请求。Sarathi-Serve引入chunked pr…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference.md\",\"basename\":\"Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference\",\"score\":256.806114378072,\"foundWords\":[\"blocks（含self/cross\",\"blocks（含convolution）和transformer\",\"blocks（self-attention\",\"blocks\",\"level\",\"level\\\"（全局）信息上，这些算子可被decompose为独立子算子在各patch上并行执行。算子分为两类：\",\"level\\\"（局部）而非\\\"image\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":31},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":109},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":214},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":273},{\"match\":\"le