{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"167199aa-e0d2-499b-82c4-30129f80ed7b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_0TJpI54TSGNORI0mg3525314","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/data3/paper_analysis/learning_outputs/20260529_185938__MoEDiT多模态Video__单GPUNPU加速器__多算子微算子并发__硬件体系结构/Q4.5_L4_answer.md","content":"# Q4.5 — MoE/DiT/多模态/Video 多算子/微算子并发的 Kernel 调度框架、编译器后端、Kernel 生成方法与编程模型\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| paper_secs/.../Mirage Persistent Kernel.../span-idpage-0-0...md | 18612.5 | MPK mega-kernel 编译器+运行时，tGraph SM级图表示，event-driven in-kernel runtime |\n| paper_secs/.../Mirage.../5-In-Kernel-Parallel-Runtime.md | 11632.1 | Worker/scheduler SM分区，JIT+AOT task launch，decentralized scheduling |\n| paper_secs/.../KernelEvolve.../KernelEvolve...md | 6413.6 | Agentic kernel coding, Triton/CuTe DSL/MTIA MLIR多抽象层, 跨NVIDIA/AMD/MTIA |\n| paper_secs/.../Mirage.../span-idpage-2-0span2.2-Kernel-Fusion.md | 3456.3 | Kernel fusion→mega-kernel, CUDA Graphs vs tGraph 对比, SM级依赖分析 |\n| paper_secs/.../ACS.../E.-Comparison-with-Persistent-Thread...md | 3106.8 | Persistent thread框架限制, CUDA Graph/Dynamic Parallelism适用性分析 |\n| paper_secs/.../FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md | 1133.3 | FlashMoE persistent kernel, actor model, in-kernel scheduling, 93.17% GPU util |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture...md | 3903.6 | 达芬奇架构 Cube/Vector/Scalar Unit, CANN软件栈, Unified Buffer 256KB |\n| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton MPP...md | 2392.9 | Triton DSL→MLIR IR→PTX/SASS pipeline, compiler-centric profiling |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Wave Quantization...md | 2047.6 | Wave quantization 现象, persistent kernel 缓解方案 |\n| experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/FlashAttention-3...md | 688.1 | Warp-specialized async kernel, CUTLASS WGMMA/TMA, FP8, H100 840 TFLOPs/s |\n| idea_notes/Mirage Persistent Kernel...md | 4222.1 | MPK vs baseline 全栈对比, SM物理分区, cross-task pipelining |\n| paper_secs/.../Tilus.../2-Background.md | 1154.7 | PTX/SASS/CUDA 编程层次, tile-oriented vs schedule-oriented 编译器分类 |\n| paper_secs/.../Composing.../6.3-Compilation-Pipeline.md | 2805.0 | MLIR 编译管线, polyhedral optimization, task/kernel fusion |\n| paper_secs/.../Demystifying.../2.-CUDA-PROGRAMMING-MODEL.md | 2817.8 | CUDA Stream 并发语义, thread block scheduler, kernel concurrency |\n\n---\n\n## 检索上下文映射\n\n### S1: GPU生态框架 (Triton/CUTLASS/CUDA Graph/CUDA Stream/cuBLAS/cuDNN)\n- `paper_secs/.../Mirage.../span-idpage-2-0span2.2-Kernel-Fusion.md` (score: 3456.3, query: `\"persistent kernel\" concurrency \"CUDA Graph\"`): kernel fusion→mega-kernel, CUDA Graphs 仅捕获 kernel 级依赖，tGraph 操作在 SM 任务粒度\n- `paper_secs/.../KernelEvolve...md` (score: 6413.6, query: `PTX SASS instruction mapping Triton`): Triton, CuTe DSL, Triton-MLIR, PTX/CUBIN 多层抽象\n- `paper_secs/.../Tilus.../2-Background.md` (score: 1154.7, query: `PTX SASS instruction mapping Triton`): PTX/SASS/CUDA 层次, Triton tile programming, TVM schedule-oriented\n- `experiment_notes/.../FlashAttention-3...md` (score: 688.1, query: `kernel benchmark Triton CUTLASS`): CUTLASS WGMMA/TMA/setmaxnreg, warp-specialized persistent kernel\n\n### S2: NPU生态框架 (CANN/TBE/TIK/Ascend)\n- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture...md` (score: 3903.6, query: `Ascend 达芬奇 架构 Cube Vector`): Da Vinci 架构 Cube/Vector/Scalar Unit, CANN 对标 CUDA, Ascend C (SPMD)\n- 其他目录无 CANN/TBE/TIK 专项笔记 — NPU kernel 编程细节笔记证据不足\n\n### S3: TPU/加速器生态 (JAX/XLA/Groq)\n- `paper_secs/.../TAIDL.../span-idpage-8-4span6.3...md` (score: 1134.0, query: `JAX XLA TPU kernel generation`): XLA-HLO, TPU, jaxlib references\n- Groq Compiler/TSP 专项笔记缺失 — 该链条节点无 note evidence\n\n### S4: 跨平台框架 (TVM/MLIR)\n- `paper_secs/.../Composing.../6.3-Compilation-Pipeline.md` (score: 2805.0, query: `MLIR kernel compilation GPU dialect`): MLIR 编译管线, polyhedral loop fusion, task/kernel fusion\n- `paper_secs/.../KernelEvolve...md` (score: 4805.1, query: `MLIR \"triton-gpu\" \"nvgpu\" kernel dialect`): MLIR dialects (GPU/AMDGPU/MTIA), Triton-MLIR\n- TVM AutoScheduler/MetaSchedule 专项笔记缺失\n\n### S5: 并发Kernel调度 (persistent kernel/CUDA Graph DAG/dynamic parallelism)\n- `paper_secs/.../FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` (score: 1133.3, query: `\"persistent kernel\" concurrency \"CUDA Graph\"`): FlashMoE persistent kernel, actor model, tile-level parallelism, 93.17% SM util\n- `paper_secs/.../ACS.../E.-Comparison-with-Persistent-Thread...md` (score: 3106.8, query: `\"persistent kernel\" concurrency \"CUDA Graph\"`): PT框架限制, dynamic parallelism 适用场景\n- `knowledge_notes/.../Wave Quantization...md` (score: 2047.6, query: `\"persistent kernel\" concurrency GPU`): persistent kernel 缓解 wave quantization\n\n### S6: 框架→硬件指令映射 (硬件体系结构侧重)\n- `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton MPP...md` (score: 2392.9, query: `PTX SASS Triton instruction pipeline`): Triton DSL→MLIR IR→PTX/SASS→runtime APIs→hardware counters 全链路\n- `paper_secs/.../Tilus.../2-Background.md` (score: 1154.7, query: `PTX SASS instruction mapping Triton`): CUDA/PTX/SASS 层次关系, tile VM 显式内存层次\n\n---\n\n## 一、方法细节：Kernel 调度框架的数据流、架构与运行时调度\n\n### 方法1: Triton — Block-Level Programming + Automatic Tiling + Triton-IR → PTX → SASS\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Triton MPP...md` (score: 2392.9), `paper_secs/.../Tilus.../2-Background.md` (score: 1154.7), `paper_secs/.../KernelEvolve...md` (score: 6413.6)\n\n**核心理念**: Triton 将 GPU 编程从 thread 级提升到 block 级，程序员定义 thread block 行为，Triton compiler 自动处理 tiling、shared memory allocation 和 thread 映射。在 Triton 中，tile 替代标量作为基本数据类型。\n\n**编译流水线 (硬件体系结构侧重)**:\n\n```\nTriton DSL (Python)\n    │  @triton.jit + block-level program\n    ▼\nTriton-IR (MLIR-based, triton-gpu dialect)\n    │  tile-level optimization, automatic tiling, shared memory allocation\n    ▼\nMLIR → LLVM-IR → PTX (Parallel Thread Execution, NVIDIA虚拟ISA)\n    │  register allocation, instruction scheduling, warp-level mapping\n    ▼\nPTX → SASS (native GPU microcode, 由 GPU driver JIT 编译)\n    │  final instruction encoding, dual-issue scheduling, scoreboarding\n    ▼\nNVIDIA GPU SM (Streaming Multiprocessor)\n    warp scheduler → dispatch unit → CUDA Cores / Tensor Cores / SFUs\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **Triton-IR 抽象层次**: 介于高层算子描述和低层 PTX 之间。关键的 triton-gpu dialect 包含 tile-level operations（如 `tt.load`, `tt.dot`, `tt.store`），compiler 自动将 tile 操作展开为 thread-level PTX 指令。\n- **Automatic Tiling 原理**: Triton compiler 根据问题 shape 和 GPU 参数（shared memory 大小、warp 数量）自动确定 tile size。用户仅需指定 `BLOCK_SIZE` 等 hint，剩余由 auto-tuner 搜索最优配置。\n- **硬件并发抽象**: Triton 将 warp scheduler 抽象为 block-level SPMD——程序员不直接管理 warp/wavefront，但可通过 `tl.dot` (MMA) 利用 Tensor Core。对于 warp-specialization（如 FlashAttention-3 的 producer-consumer warp），Triton 原生不支持，需 hand-coded CUDA。\n- **局限**: 笔记显示 Triton 不暴露 GPU memory hierarchy（register file vs shared memory 的显式控制），也不支持非 2 的幂 bit-width 数据类型（需手动 unpack），在低精度 kernel 中 layout conversion 通过 shared memory 完成，导致额外开销。\n\n---\n\n### 方法2: CUTLASS — Tile Iterator + Warp Tile + MMA Abstraction\n\n**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/FlashAttention-3...md` (score: 688.1), `paper_secs/.../FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` (score: 1133.3), `paper_secs/.../KernelEvolve...md` (score: 6413.6)\n\n**CUTLASS v3 核心抽象与数据**:\n\nCUTLASS 将 GEMM/Conv/Attention 分解为分层 tile：\n\n```\nGlobal Memory (HBM)\n    │  TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator) async copy\n    ▼\nShared Memory (SMEM, 228KB/SM on H100)\n    │  ldmatrix / cp.async → registers\n    ▼\nRegister File (per-thread, 256 registers/thread max on H100)\n    │  WGMMA (Warp Group Matrix Multiply-Accumulate)\n    ▼\nTensor Core (MMA unit, FP16: 989 TFLOPs, FP8: 1978 TFLOPs on H100)\n```\n\n**Kernel 伪代码 — CUTLASS v3 Persistent Kernel (FlashAttention-3 风格, H100)**:\n\n```\n// 输入: Q[batch, heads, seq, dim], K/V 同上, H100 SMs=132\n// Grid: 132 threadblocks (persistent, 每 SM 一个)\n// 每个 CTA: 3 warpgroups (producer=1 warp, consumer1=2 warps, consumer2=2 warps)\n\ndef flash_attn_v3_persistent_kernel(Q_hbm, K_hbm, V_hbm, O_hbm):\n    sm_id = blockIdx.x                            // persistent: 1 CTA per SM\n    smem_Q = AllocateShared([Br, 128], dtype=bf16) // Q tile buffer\n    smem_K = AllocateShared([128, 128], dtype=bf16) // K tile buffer (circular, 2-stage)\n    smem_V = AllocateShared([128, 128], dtype=bf16) // V tile buffer (circular)\n    \n    for tile_i in range(sm_id, total_Q_tiles, gridDim.x):  // grid-stride loop\n        // === Producer Warp (1 warp, setmaxnreg=32 registers) ===\n        TMA_Load(smem_Q, Q_hbm[tile_i])           // async Q load\n        cp_async_commit_group()\n        \n        O_reg = zeros([Br, 128])                  // FP32 accumulator in registers\n        l_reg = zeros([Br])                        // softmax denominator\n        m_reg = neg_inf([Br])                      // softmax max\n        \n        for tile_j in range(0, num_KV_tiles):\n            // Producer: async prefetch K_j, V_j\n            TMA_Load(smem_K, K_hbm[tile_j])\n            TMA_Load(smem_V, V_hbm[tile_j])\n            cp_async_commit_group()\n            cp_async_wait_group(1)                 // wait for prev stage\n            \n            // === Consumer Warpgroup (4 warps, setmaxnreg=232) ===\n            // Stage 1: QK^T via WGMMA (asynchronously launched)\n            S_tile = WGMMA_SS(smem_Q, smem_K)      // SS: both operands from SMEM\n            // S_tile shape: [Br, 128], dtype: FP32\n            \n            // Stage 2: 与 Stage 1 重叠 — softmax(上一迭代的 S)\n            if tile_j > 0:\n                m_new = rowmax(S_prev)\n                l_corr = exp(m_prev - m_new)       // 校正因子\n                l_new = l_corr * l_prev + rowsum(exp(S_prev - m_new))\n                O_reg = l_corr * O_reg              // 重新缩放旧输出\n                \n                P_tile = exp(S_prev - m_new)        // softmax probabilities\n                O_reg += WGMMA_RS(P_tile, smem_V)   // RS: P from register, V from SMEM\n            \n            // 旋转: 当前 S 成为下一轮的 S_prev\n            S_prev, m_prev, l_prev = S_tile, m_new, l_new\n            cp_async_wait_group(0)                 // wait for current stage done\n        \n        // Epilogue: 最终 rescale + TMA store\n        O_reg = diag(1.0 / l_new) * O_reg\n        TMA_Store(O_hbm[tile_i], O_reg)\n```\n\n**指令 Pipeline 时序图 (单 CTA, 2-stage GEMM-softmax Pipelining)**:\n\n```\nTime →   T0-T3        T4-T7        T8-T11       T12-T15      T16-T19\n─────────┬────────────┬────────────┬────────────┬────────────┬────────────\nProducer │TMA Q load  │TMA K0,V0   │TMA K1,V1   │TMA K2,V2   │TMA K3,V3\n(Warp 0) │commit      │commit      │commit      │commit      │commit\n─────────┼────────────┼────────────┼────────────┼────────────┼────────────\nConsumer │            │WGMMA QK^T0 │WGMMA QK^T1 │WGMMA QK^T2 │WGMMA QK^T3\nWarpGrp1 │  idle      │(async)     │(async)     │(async)     │(async)\n(4 warps)│            │            │            │            │\n─────────┼────────────┼────────────┼────────────┼────────────┼────────────\nConsumer │            │softmax(S0) │softmax(S1) │softmax(S2) │softmax(S3)\nWarpGrp1 │  idle      │+ WGMMA PV0 │+ WGMMA PV1 │+ WGMMA PV2 │+ WGMMA PV3\n(cont.)  │            │            │            │            │\n─────────┴────────────┴────────────┴────────────┴────────────┴────────────\nTensor Core 利用率: ~85% (WGMMA 持续发射，softmax 在 warp 级重叠)\nHBM 带宽利用率: ~80% (TMA 持续 prefetch，circular buffer 2-stage)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **WGMMA (Warp Group MMA)**: Hopper 架构引入，允许单个 warp group（4 warps）异步发射矩阵乘法。SS 前缀=两个操作数都从 SMEM 读；RS 前缀=第一个操作数从 register 读。WGMMA 发射后不 block，允许与 softmax 等 ALU 操作重叠。\n- **setmaxnreg**: Hopper 的寄存器重分配指令。Producer warp 释放寄存器（仅需 32 个，用于 TMA 地址计算），释放的寄存器分配给 consumer warpgroup（232 个），使 WGMMA 有充足寄存器缓冲。\n- **TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator)**: Hopper 的新硬件单元。从 HBM 到 SMEM 的异步 DMA，支持多维 tile 寻址（无需手动计算 offset），可减少 address generation 和 loop overhead。\n- **Occupancy**: Persistent kernel（132 CTA = 132 SMs），每 CTA 5 warps。H100 每 SM 最多 64 warps，occupancy = 5/64 ≈ 7.8%，但这是**有意为之**——低 occupancy 换取更多 registers/CTA（232 registers × 128 threads），最大化单 thread 计算密度。笔记显示 FlashAttention-3 在 H100 上达到 840 TFLOPs/s（85% 理论峰值）。\n\n---\n\n### 方法3: CUDA Graph — Kernel Graph DAG 并发启动与依赖管理\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../Mirage.../span-idpage-2-0span2.2-Kernel-Fusion.md` (score: 3456.3), `paper_secs/.../ACS.../E.-Comparison-with-Persistent-Thread...md` (score: 3106.8), `paper_secs/.../FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` (score: 1133.3)\n\n**核心机制**:\n\nCUDA Graph 将一系列 kernel launch 及其依赖关系预录制为 GPU-executable graph，消除 CPU-side kernel launch overhead。\n\n```\n传统 Kernel Launch (per-operator):\nCPU: launch(K1) → wait → launch(K2) → wait → launch(K3) → ...\nGPU:    [K1 exec] → barrier → [K2 exec] → barrier → [K3 exec] → ...\n\nCUDA Graph (kernel graph):\nCPU: graph.launch()  ← 单次调用\nGPU: [K1] ──→ [K2] ──→ [K3]         ← 静态 DAG, 无 CPU-GPU round-trip\n      \\                /\n       └──→ [K4] ────┘                 ← 支持 fork/join 并发\n```\n\n**与 MPK tGraph 的对比 (从硬件体系结构角度)**:\n\n| 维度 | CUDA Graph | MPK tGraph |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| 依赖粒度 | Kernel 级 | SM 级 (task) |\n| 同步机制 | Stream semantics | Event-driven (device memory semaphore) |\n| 并发粒度 | 多 kernel 同发（kernel barrier 间不可重叠） | 跨算子 computation/communication 在 SM 间重叠 |\n| 动态性 | 静态捕获，batch size 变化需重建 | JIT task launch 支持动态 work distribution |\n| Launch overhead | 降为 ∼5-10μs (vs ∼50μs per-kernel) | 仅 1 次 kernel launch（∼1μs） |\n| MoE 支持 | 不兼容 dynamic routing（CUDA Graph 无法表达 conditional dispatch） | 原生支持（hybrid workload balancer + runtime metadata） |\n\n**注解**:\n- 笔记显示，Megatron-LM + DeepEP 的 MoE 实现每 forward pass 发射 432 个 kernel，FlashMoE 通过 persistent kernel 降至 1 个。CUDA Graph 可减少但无法消除此 overhead，且不兼容 MoE 的动态路由模式。\n- ACS 论文指出 CUDA Graph 对 input-dependent 计算图不适用——构建 graph 的延迟与执行时间相当或更长。\n\n---\n\n### 方法4: CUDA Stream — 多 Stream 异步并发\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../Demystifying.../2.-CUDA-PROGRAMMING-MODEL.md` (score: 2817.8), `paper_secs/.../HuntKTm.../HuntKTm...md` (score: 2432.5)\n\n**并发模型**:\n\n```\nCPU Process\n  ├── Stream 0 (default): [K1_GEMM] → [K2_Activation] → [K3_Norm]\n  ├── Stream 1:          [K4_Attention_Q] → [K5_Attention_K]\n  └── Stream 2:          [K6_D2H_copy] → (overlap with compute)\n\nGPU SM 资源在 stream 间竞争:\n  - SM partitioning: Stream 0 占 80 SMs, Stream 1 占 28 SMs\n  - 或 spatial sharing: 所有 stream 共享全部 SM, warp scheduler round-robin\n  - 或 temporal sharing: MPS (Multi-Process Service) / MIG (Multi-Instance GPU) 时间片\n```\n\n**Kernel 伪代码 — 多 Stream MoE Expert FFN 并发**:\n\n```\n// 将 MoE 的不同 expert 分配到不同 stream 实现并发\ncudaStream_t streams[NUM_EXPERTS];\n\nfor expert_id in range(NUM_EXPERTS):\n    cudaStreamCreate(&streams[expert_id])\n\n// 异步启动各个 expert FFN\nfor expert_id, tokens in expert_to_tokens.items():\n    // 每个 expert 在独立 stream 中执行\n    dim3 grid = calc_grid(tokens.shape, EXPERT_TILE_SIZE)\n    cudaLaunchKernel(expert_ffn_kernel, grid, BLOCK_SIZE,\n                     0, streams[expert_id],\n                     tokens, expert_weights[expert_id], output_buffer)\n    // 无需等待其他 expert — 全部异步\n\n// 所有 expert 完成后 barrier\nfor expert_id in range(NUM_EXPERTS):\n    cudaStreamSynchronize(streams[expert_id])\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **硬件并发限制**: H100 最多支持 128 个并发 stream，但实际并发 kernel 数受限于 SM 资源（registers、shared memory）。如果每个 kernel 需要的资源超过 SM 剩余容量，后续 kernel 会排队等待。\n- **Wave Quantization 效应**（笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Wave Quantization...md` score: 2047.6）: 当每个 expert 的 token 数不均时，FFN kernel 的 thread block 数可能远少于 SM 数，导致严重 SM idle。多 stream 并发不能解决此问题——需 persistent kernel + dynamic work stealing。\n- **NVIDIA TX2 研究**: 笔记显示 GPU thread block scheduler 在并发 kernel 间采用 round-robin 分配 SM，可能导致 compute-bound 和 memory-bound kernel 的资源竞争。\n\n---\n\n### 方法5: FlashMoE — Actor-Based Persistent Kernel for MoE\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` (score: 1133.3)\n\n**架构数据流 (Actor Model)**:\n\n```\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│               FlashMoE Persistent Kernel              │\n│                                                       │\n│  ┌─────────────┐   task descriptors    ┌───────────┐ │\n│  │ Subscriber  │──────────────────────→│ Scheduler │ │\n│  │ (1 warp)    │  decode remote tiles  │ (1 warp)  │ │\n│  │             │←──────────────────────│           │ │\n│  │ NVSHMEM DMA │  notify task ready    │ dispatch  │ │\n│  └─────────────┘                       │ tasks ↓   │ │\n│                                        └───────────┘ │\n│                                        ┌───────────┐ │\n│  GPU 0                                 │Processor 0│ │\n│  SM 0                                  │Processor 1│ │\n│  SM 1           ┌────shared mem────┐   │Processor 2│ │\n│  SM 2           │ Sub↔Sched queue  │   │  ...      │ │\n│  ...            └──────────────────┘   │Processor N│ │\n│  SM N-1                                └───────────┘ │\n│                  (N-1 SMs 执行 FFN/Combine GEMM)      │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n         ↑ NVSHMEM one-sided DMA (UVA) ↑\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│               GPU 1: 相同 Actor 架构                    │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Kernel 伪代码 (FlashMoE 分布式 MoE Fused Kernel)**:\n\n```\nInput: A ∈ R^{S×H} (input tokens), X ∈ R^{E×H×D} (expert weights)\n       N = SM count per GPU\n\ndef FlashMoE_FusedKernel(A, X, N):\n    T_phi, G_phi = FusedGate(A)                    // gate + top-k + routing table\n    \n    if blockIdx < N - 1:                           // Processor blocks (N-1 SMs)\n        Dispatch(T_phi, A)                         // 打包 tokens 到对称 tensor layout\n        processor::start()                          // 进入 work-stealing loop:\n        while True:                                 //   dequeue task descriptor\n            t = task_queue.dequeue()                //   t = (metadata, op, activation)\n            if t is None: break\n            F_t(A_tile, B_weight, C, D)            //   C = φ(A ⋆_t B + D)\n            notify_trigger_event(t.event)            //   通知 scheduler\n    \n    else:                                            // OS block (1 SM)\n        if warpID == 0:\n            scheduler::start()                       // event loop:\n            while True:                              //   poll events → dispatch ready tasks\n                e = event_queue.poll()               //   → enqueue to processor task queues\n                if e.activated:\n                    for t in e.task_range:\n                        processor[t % (N-1)].enqueue(t)\n        elif warpID <= 3:\n            subscriber::start(T_phi, G_phi, O, X)   // DMA receive loop:\n            while True:                              //   poll NVSHMEM signals\n                pkt = NVSHMEM_wait_signal()          //   decode remote tile packets\n                task_desc = decode(pkt)              //   → enqueue to scheduler event queue\n                scheduler.notify(task_desc)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **Tile 维度选择**: FlashMoE 选择 (128, 64) tile 尺寸。增大 tile width→寄存器压力骤升→spill to local memory；增大 tile height→per-thread 工作量增加；增大 block 线程数→减少并发 CTA→降低 occupancy。笔记显示此平衡点是「经过 careful parameter sweeps」得出的。\n- **对称 Tensor Layout**: 通过引入 temporal buffering（overprovision 2×r 倍内存，r=communication rounds），实现 write-write conflict-free 的 one-sided DMA，消除同步开销。内存 overhead ≤ 2%。\n- **实验结果**: FlashMoE 达到 93.17% GPU SM 利用率，vs DeepEP 的 13.55%（6.8×），vs Megatron-TE 的 59.11%（4×）。即使 FlashMoE 使用 FP32（baseline 用 FP16），仍获 6× latency speedup。\n\n---\n\n### 方法6: Mirage Persistent Kernel (MPK) — Compiler + Runtime for Mega-Kernel\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../Mirage.../span-idpage-0-0...md` (score: 18612.5), `paper_secs/.../Mirage.../5-In-Kernel-Parallel-Runtime.md` (score: 11632.1), `paper_secs/.../Mirage.../span-idpage-8-0span6.1-Implementation-Details.md` (score: 2008.6), `idea_notes/Mirage Persistent Kernel...md` (score: 4222.1)\n\n**SM 级分区架构 (H100, 132 SMs)**:\n\n```\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│              MPK Mega-Kernel (single launch)               │\n│                                                           │\n│  ┌──────────┐   ┌──────────┐          ┌──────────┐       │\n│  │Sched SM 0│   │Sched SM 1│   ...    │Sched SM 3│       │\n│  │4 warps   │   │4 warps   │          │4 warps   │       │\n│  │event Q   │   │event Q   │          │event Q   │       │\n│  │→dispatch │   │→dispatch │          │→dispatch │       │\n│  └────┬─────┘   └────┬─────┘          └────┬─────┘       │\n│       │  decentralized scheduling           │              │\n│       ▼              ▼                      ▼              │\n│  ┌──────────┐   ┌──────────┐          ┌──────────┐       │\n│  │Worker 0  │   │Worker 1  │   ...    │Worker 127│       │\n│  │task Q    │   │task Q    │          │task Q    │       │\n│  │execute   │   │execute   │          │execute   │       │\n│  │→notify   │   │→notify   │          │→notify   │       │\n│  └──────────┘   └──────────┘          └──────────┘       │\n│  128 Workers (每 SM 一个), 16 Scheduler warps (4 SMs)     │\n│  B200: 144 Workers + 16 Schedulers (148 SMs)              │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**tGraph 编译流水线**:\n\n```\nPyTorch Model (torch.compile(backend=MPK))\n    │\n    ▼\nComputation Graph (DAG of tensor operators)\n    │\n    ├── Operator Decomposition: 每个 operator 按输出维度 tiling → 生成 SM 级 tasks\n    ├── Dependency Analysis: per-task-pair overlap check → 插入 fine-grained events\n    ├── Event Fusion: successor-set + predecessor-set fusion → 消除冗余同步\n    ├── tGraph Normalization: fan-in/fan-out ≤ 1 (引入空 dummy tasks)\n    ├── tGraph Linearization: BFS, 确保同一 event 的 tasks 连续存储\n    └── Task Code Generation: Mirage superoptimizer → 优化 CUDA kernel\n    │\n    ▼\nMega-Kernel Callable (单个 PyTorch function)\n    │\n    ▼\nGPU In-Kernel Runtime (event-driven, worker/scheduler 分离)\n```\n\n**Kernel 伪代码 — MPK Worker Persistent Loop**:\n\n```\n// 每个 Worker SM 执行的 persistent loop\ndef MPK_Worker_Loop(task_array, event_array):\n    sm_id = blockIdx.x                              // worker SM index\n    task_queue = circular_buffer_init()              // GPU device memory, atomicAdd enqueue\n    \n    while True:\n        t = task_queue.dequeue(sm_id)               // atomicAdd 获取下一个 task 索引\n        if t is None: break\n        \n        // === 执行 task t ===\n        config = task_array[t]                      // 352 bytes: event indices, tensor ptrs\n        \n        // Phase 1: Pre-loading (cross-task pipelining)\n        if config.has_prefetch:\n            input_tile = TMA_Load_prefetch(config.src_ptr, config.tile_shape)\n        \n        // Phase 2: 执行计算或通信\n        if config.is_compute:\n            output = mirage_generated_kernel(input_tile, config.params)\n        elif config.is_communicate:\n            NVSHMEM_put_signal(output_tile, config.remote_pe, config.remote_addr)\n        \n        // Phase 3: 通知触发事件\n        ev = event_array[config.trigger_event]\n        count = atomicAdd(&ev.trigger_count, 1)     // 原子计数\n        if count + 1 == ev.required_count:\n            ev.activated = true                       // 所有生产者完成→事件激活\n            scheduler_notify(ev)                      // 通知 scheduler\n```\n\n**注解 (硬件体系结构)**:\n- **Decentralized Scheduling**: Scheduler 仅用 local state 调度，无全局协调。Task 和 event 队列为 GPU device memory 中的 circular buffer，enqueue/dequeue 仅用 `atomicAdd`。笔记显示「per-task overhead 极小」。\n- **Cross-Task Pipelining**: MPK 将每个 task 拆为 pre-load 和 compute 两阶段。当前 task compute 期间即通过 TMA 预取下一 task 的输入 tile（利用 paged shared-memory abstraction）。Ablation 显示：Qwen3-8B final linear layer on B200 上 1.2-1.3× speedup。\n- **Compute-Communication Overlap**: MPK 在 task 对级别分析依赖（非 operator 级别）。例如 MatMul→AllReduce：每个 AllReduce task 仅依赖一个对应 MatMul task 的输出 tile，使 compute 和 communication 在不同 SM 组上并发。Ablation 显示 1.1× speedup。\n- **端到端性能**: Qwen3-8B on A100, 单 batch decode, MPK 12.5ms/token vs vLLM 14.5ms。理论下限 ~10ms（模型参数加载时间/1.6TB/s HBM 带宽），MPK 仅比下限高 ~25%。\n\n---\n\n### 方法7: NPU 生态 — CANN/TBE/TIK + Ascend Da Vinci 架构\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture...md` (score: 3903.6)\n\n**Da Vinci 架构数据流**:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                 Ascend NPU (Atlas 800I A2)               │\n│                                                         │\n│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  │\n│  │  AI Core      │  │  AI Vector   │  │  Scalar Unit │  │\n│  │  (Cube Unit)  │  │  (Vector)    │  │              │  │\n│  │  16×16×16     │  │  256-bit     │  │  1-2 ops/    │  │\n│  │  MAC Array    │  │  SIMD        │  │  cycle       │  │\n│  │  → MatMul     │  │  → Act/Comm  │  │  → Control   │  │\n│  └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬───────┘  └──────┬───────┘  │\n│         │                 │                 │          │\n│         └─────────┬───────┴─────────────────┘          │\n│                   │                                     │\n│            ┌──────▼──────┐                              │\n│            │  Unified    │                              │\n│            │  Buffer     │                              │\n│            │  (256KB)    │                              │\n│            └──────┬──────┘                              │\n│                   │                                     │\n│            ┌──────▼──────┐                              │\n│            │    HBM      │                              │\n│            │   (64 GB)   │                              │\n│            └─────────────┘                              │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **Cube Unit 约束**: 16×16×16 MAC 阵列决定矩阵乘 tile 尺寸必须是 16 的倍数。与 GPU Tensor Core 的 16×16×16 MMA tile 相同形状，但 Cube Unit 不通过 warp 调度——由专用的指令队列 (MTE) 驱动。\n- **Cube/Vector 并发**: 三类单元（Scalar/Vector/Cube）有独立指令队列，支持同时取指、并行执行。EPD-Serve 利用此特性实现 operator-level 空间复用——MatMul 在 Cube Unit 执行时，Vector Unit 同时做 AllReduce 或 LayerNorm。\n- **CANN 软件栈**: 对标 CUDA——Ascend C (SPMD 编程范式)、Graph Engine (GE)、Ascend Operator Library。开发者通过 PyTorch Ascend Adapter 间接使用，不直接写 Ascend C。\n- **笔记未覆盖**: CANN/TBE/TIK 的具体 kernel 编程 API、tile 配置方法、Ascend 的 stream/model 并发细节在 vault 笔记中缺失。以下内容为可推断和 Web 补充。\n\n**可推断**: TBE (Tensor Boost Engine) 提供 DSL 描述算子计算逻辑，TIK (Tensor Iterator Kernel) 提供更低层的 tile 级编程接口。与 Triton 类似，TBE 自动处理 tiling 和 buffer 管理；与 CUTLASS 类似，TIK 允许显式控制数据搬运和计算流水线。\n\n---\n\n### 方法8: 跨平台 — MLIR-based Kernel 编译 (Diffuse/KernelEvolve)\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../Composing.../6.3-Compilation-Pipeline.md` (score: 2805.0), `paper_secs/.../KernelEvolve...md` (score: 6413.6)\n\n**MLIR 编译管线 (Diffuse 的 Task/Kernel Fusion)**:\n\n```\ncuPyNumeric Program (distributed array operations)\n    │\n    ▼\nDistributed IR (scale-free, 分布式数据模型依赖分析)\n    │\n    ├── Task Identification: 识别可融合的 index tasks 序列\n    ├── Task Fusion: 构造 MLIR module (含各 task body)\n    ├── Data Promotion: 分布式数据 → task-local allocations\n    ├── Polyhedral Optimization: loop fusion + parallelization\n    ├── Temporary Elimination: 消除 task-local temporaries\n    └── Lowering Dialects: scf/affine/memref → gpu/nvvm\n    │\n    ▼\nGPU Kernel Launch (或 OpenMP parallel region)\n```\n\n**KernelEvolve 多抽象层覆盖 (Meta 生产系统)**:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                KernelEvolve Agentic Framework         │\n│                                                      │\n│  编程抽象层:                                          │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│  │ Triton DSL (Python)  →  GPU kernel prototype │   │\n│  │ CuTe DSL (C++)       →  显式 MMA tile 控制    │   │\n│  │ Triton-MLIR          →  编译器 IR 级优化       │   │\n│  │ PTX/CUBIN            →  NVIDIA 低级指令       │   │\n│  │ AMDGPU/MTIA-MLIR     →  AMD/MTIA 方言         │   │\n│  │ Hardware diagnostics →  性能计数器/寄存器分配  │   │\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │\n│                                                      │\n│  搜索策略: Graph-based search + RAG + Persistent KB   │\n│  目标硬件: NVIDIA GPU + AMD GPU + MTIA v3 (Meta)     │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **KernelEvolve 的设计动机**: 模型架构多样性 × kernel primitive 多样性 × 硬件代际/架构多样性 → 组合爆炸的优化空间。笔记显示 KernelEvolve 的 persistent knowledge base 编码了硬件特定约束，使 LLM agent 能为训练语料中不存在的专有架构（如 MTIA v3）生成有效 kernel。\n- **MLIR 多方言协同**: triton-gpu dialect 表达 tile-level 操作，nvgpu dialect 直接映射 NVIDIA 硬件特性（TMA、WGMMA），xla dialect 表达 TPU/CPU 通用计算。跨方言 lowering 允许同一 IR 编译到不同后端。\n\n---\n\n## 二、实验环境\n\n### 各框架的主要实验平台与 Benchmark\n\n| 框架/方法 | 实验硬件 | Benchmark 数据集 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |\n|----------|---------|-----------------|---------|---------|\n| **MPK (Mirage)** | A100 (108 SMs), H100 (132 SMs), B200 (148 SMs) | Qwen3-1.7B/8B/30B-A3B, Llama3.1-8B, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B | Serving throughput (tok/s), per-token latency, 1.0-1.7× vs vLLM/SGLang | `paper_secs/.../Mirage.../span-idpage-8-0span6.1...md` |\n| **FlashMoE** | 8×H100 80GB NVLink, CUDA 12.8 | MoE Transformer (16 heads, emb=2048, FFN=2048), 32 passes after 32 warmup | Latency (6× speedup), SM util (93.17%), throughput (5.7×), overlap efficiency (4×) | `paper_secs/.../FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` |\n| **FlashAttention-3** | H100 80GB SXM5 (700W, 132 SMs, 3.35 TB/s HBM) | seqlen=8192, batch=2, nheads=16, hdim=128 | 840 TFLOPs/s (85% peak FP16), FP8: 1.3 PFLOPs/s | `experiment_notes/.../FlashAttention-3...md` |\n| **KernelEvolve** | NVIDIA H100/A100, AMD MI300X, Meta MTIA v3 | DLRM training/inference, KernelBench | Speedup over baseline, 跨硬件加速比 | `paper_secs/.../KernelEvolve...md` |\n| **CANN/TBE (EPD-Serve)** | Atlas 800I A2 (Ascend NPU, 64GB HBM) | 多模态模型 serving | AI Core/AI Vector 并发利用率 | `knowledge_notes/.../Ascend NPU Architecture...md` |\n\n**注解**:\n- MPK 实验采用固定 prompt length=64, decode 1024 tokens 的 offline setup，消除 request-arrival 变异性。笔记显示「这使系统级性能差异可归因于 MPK 而非 workload artifacts」。\n- FlashMoE 的 FP32 vs FP16 对比值得注意——FlashMoE 用 FP32 而 baseline 用 FP16，但 FlashMoE 仍胜出，说明 kernel launch overhead 和同步开销是主要瓶颈而非算力。\n\n---\n\n## 三、实现 (辅助说明)\n\n### 各框架核心实现要点\n\n| 框架 | 实现语言 | 代码量 | 关键机制 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|---------|--------|---------|---------|\n| **MPK** | C++ (40K), CUDA (84K), Python (10K) | ~134K lines | torch.compile(backend=MPK), Mirage superoptimizer, NVSHMEM | `paper_secs/.../Mirage.../span-idpage-8-0span6.1...md` |\n| **FlashMoE** | CUDA/C++, CUTLASS, NVSHMEM | 未给出 | Actor model (Processor/Subscriber/Scheduler), tile (128,64), symmetric tensor layout | `paper_secs/.../FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` |\n| **Triton** | Python DSL + MLIR-based compiler | 开源 | block-level SPMD, automatic tiling, JIT compilation | `knowledge_notes/.../Triton MPP...md` |\n| **CUTLASS v3** | C++ template | 开源 (NVIDIA) | WGMMA, TMA, setmaxnreg, persistent kernel, grouped GEMM | `experiment_notes/.../FlashAttention-3...md` |\n| **KernelEvolve** | Python + Triton + CuTe DSL | Meta 内部 | Agentic graph search, retrieval-augmented prompt, hardware KB | `paper_secs/.../KernelEvolve...md` |\n| **CANN/TBE** | Ascend C (类 C++) | 华为闭源 | SPMD 并行范式, GE 图编译器, Ascend Operator Library | `knowledge_notes/.../Ascend NPU Architecture...md` |\n\n---\n\n## 四、是什么？ (辅助说明)\n\n### 各框架的核心定位\n\n1. **Triton** (OpenAI → 开源社区): 将 GPU kernel 编程复杂度从 thread 级降低到 block 级。程序员写 block-level Python，编译器自动生成高效 PTX。适用场景：快速原型开发、element-wise/reduction/GEMM kernel、非标准数据类型的探索。不适合需要 warp-specialization 的场景。\n\n2. **CUTLASS** (NVIDIA): 基于 C++ template 的 GPU 线性代数库，提供分层 tile 抽象（tile iterator→warp tile→thread tile→MMA instruction），但需要显式管理数据搬运和同步。适用场景：极致优化的 GEMM/Conv/Attention kernel，特别是需要利用 Hopper TMA/WGMMA/FP8 新特性的场景。\n\n3. **CUDA Graph** (NVIDIA Runtime): 将 kernel launch DAG 预录制以减少 CPU-GPU 同步开销。适用场景：静态计算图 (batch size/shape 固定)、latency-sensitive 推理。不适用：动态 shape/batch、MoE conditional routing。\n\n4. **CANN/TBE/TIK** (华为): Ascend NPU 的异构计算架构。TBE 为算子级 DSL，自动 tiling；TIK 为 tile 级编程接口，类似 CUTLASS。依托 Da Vinci 架构的三类计算单元实现算子并发。\n\n5. **XLA** (Google): 为 TPU 设计的 JIT 编译器。从 JAX/TensorFlow 的 HLO (High-Level Operations) IR 出发，经 target-dependent lowering 生成 TPU/GPU/CPU 指令。TPU 的 128×128/128×256 MXU 约束决定其 tile 尺寸。\n\n6. **TVM/MLIR** (Apache/LLVM): 跨硬件平台的编译框架。TVM 的 AutoScheduler/MetaSchedule 通过 cost model 搜索最优 tile 配置；MLIR 的 multi-dialect 设计允许同一 IR 表达不同硬件的并发特性。\n\n7. **MPK/FlashMoE (Mega-Kernel)**: 将整个模型编译为单个 persistent kernel，消除 kernel launch overhead、pipeline bubble 和 CPU-side scheduling 延迟。代表了从「kernel 级」到「SM 级」的抽象层次下沉。\n\n---\n\n## 五、方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心机制 | 编程抽象层次 | 多算子/微算子并发方式 | 硬件平台 | 框架→硬件指令映射路径 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|-------------|---------------------|---------|---------------------|---------|---------|\n| **Triton** | Block-level SPMD + auto tiling | Block 级 (高于 CUDA) | 单 kernel 内 tile-level 并发；跨 kernel 需手动 CUDA Stream | NVIDIA GPU | Triton DSL → Triton-IR (MLIR) → LLVM-IR → PTX → SASS | 接近手写 CUDA 性能，开发效率高 | Triton MPP (score: 2392.9), Tilus (score: 1154.7) |\n| **CUTLASS v3** | Tile iterator + WGMMA + TMA + persistent kernel | Warp/Warpgroup 级 (低于 Triton) | Persistent kernel 内 warp-specialized 流水线；FP8/BF16 混合精度并发 | NVIDIA H100 (Hopper) | C++ template → PTX → SASS (直接控制 MMA tile shape) | H100 840 TFLOPs/s (85% peak) | FlashAttention-3 (score: 688.1) |\n| **CUDA Graph** | Kernel DAG 预录制 | Kernel 级 | 多 kernel 在 DAG 中 fork/join 并发 | NVIDIA GPU (CUDA 10+) | N/A (runtime API, 不改 kernel 代码) | Launch overhead: ∼5μs vs ∼50μs per-kernel | ACS (score: 3106.8) |\n| **CUDA Stream** | Multi-stream async dispatch | Kernel 级 | 多 stream 内 kernel 时间片/SM 空间分区并发 | NVIDIA GPU | N/A (runtime API) | 实际并发受 SM 资源限制 | Demystifying TBS (score: 2817.8) |\n| **FlashMoE** | Actor model persistent kernel | Warp 级 (Processor/Subscriber/Scheduler) | Single persistent kernel: tile 级 work stealing + async DMA 并发 | 8×H100 NVLink | CUTLASS + NVSHMEM → PTX → SASS | 93.17% SM util, 6× speedup | FlashMoE (score: 1133.3) |\n| **MPK (Mirage)** | SM-level tGraph + mega-kernel compiler | SM 级 (最低) | Worker/Scheduler 分区: 128 workers + 16 scheduler warps, event-driven | A100/H100/B200, multi-GPU | PyTorch → tGraph → Mirage superopt → CUDA + NVSHMEM | A100 1.0-1.7× vs vLLM/SGLang, 1.1× comm overlap | MPK (score: 18612.5, 11632.1) |\n| **CANN/TBE** | Da Vinci Cube/Vector 异构 | Operator 级 (TBE) / Tile 级 (TIK) | Cube Unit + Vector Unit 并行执行 (独立指令队列) | Ascend 910B/310P | TBE → TIK IR → NPU 指令 (Cube/Vector/Scalar) | EPD-Serve operator-level 空间复用 | Ascend NPU (score: 3903.6) |\n| **XLA (TPU)** | HLO → TPU 指令 JIT | Operator 级 | TPU MXU 128×128 systolic array 驱动 tile 并发 | TPU v5e/v5p | JAX → HLO → XLA → TPU binary | 笔记未给出具体 benchmark | TAIDL (score: 1134.0) |\n| **MLIR (Diffuse)** | Multi-dialect IR + polyhedral fusion | Dialect 级 (跨抽象层) | Task fusion → kernel fusion → loop fusion, 跨 dialect lowering | NVIDIA GPU, multi-core CPU | MLIR (scf/affine/memref→gpu/nvvm) | 笔记未给出具体性能数据 | Diffuse (score: 2805.0) |\n| **KernelEvolve** | Agentic graph search + multi-abstraction | 跨 Triton→CuTe→PTX/CUBIN | 搜索空间覆盖 Triton+CuTe+低层指令的并发组合 | NVIDIA/AMD/MTIA v3 | Triton/CuTe → PTX/CUBIN/AMDGPU/MTIA-MLIR | KernelBench 上跨硬件加速 | KernelEvolve (score: 6413.6) |\n\n---\n\n## 六、不确定性\n\n1. **CANN/TBE/TIK 细节缺失**: vault 笔记中仅有一条 knowledge_notes 描述 Ascend NPU 架构概览，缺少 TBE DSL 语法、TIK tile 编程示例、Ascend stream/model 并发机制的具体内容。华为 CANN 文档为闭源，vault 未收录。NPU kernel 编程的详细方法与 GPU 生态的对比证据不足。\n\n2. **Groq Compiler/TSP**: vault 笔记中无 Groq LPU/TSP compiler 的专项记录。其 deterministic scheduling 的独特优势无法从笔记证据展开。\n\n3. **TVM AutoScheduler/MetaSchedule**: 笔记中仅在 Tilus 背景和 KernelEvolve 中作为 related work 提及。TVM 的 tile 搜索算法（cost model、evolutionary search）和 schedule template 语法在 vault 中无专项笔记。\n\n4. **JAX/XLA TPU 性能数据**: 笔记中 TAIDL 仅涉及 XLA-HLO 格式编译验证，没有 TPU v5e/v5p 上 MoE/DiT/多模态/Video 模型的 kernel 性能 benchmark。XLA 的 TPU kernel 生成细节（HLO→LLO→TPU binary 的完整路径）证据不足。\n\n5. **Persistent kernel 的通用性**: ACS 论文明确指出 persistent thread 框架假设所有 tasks homogeneous（相同 register/shared memory 使用），heterogeneous tasks 会导致 persistent kernel 使用 max(registers) 而降低 occupancy 和并行度。笔记显示 PT 框架比 baseline 慢 1.35×。这意味着 mega-kernel 方法对算子多样性大的模型（如多模态）可能存在效率下降，但 MPK 通过 compile-time task decomposition 和 Mirage superoptimizer 部分缓解了此问题。\n\n6. **笔记未说明的交叉领域**:\n   - DiT diffusion denoising 的多 step kernel 调度（denoising step 间依赖与 step 内并发的权衡）\n   - 多模态 cross-attention fusion kernel 的具体 Triton/CUTLASS 实现\n   - Video 3D convolution 在 NPU/TPU 上的 tile 映射\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q4.5\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":103396,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"481c05ba-2d76-4ba8-b9b0-f0e1195499be","uuid":"3d71baad-b6e6-4392-9507-0ed23bd8d54f"}
